        "elType": "widget",
        "widgetType": "html",
        "settings": {
          "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"story\"><div class=\"container story-grid\"><div class=\"story-card reveal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"story-glass\"></div></div><div class=\"story-copy reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The everyday reset</span><h2>Somewhere between busy and better.</h2><p>Most of us remember to drink water only when we're already running on empty. The bottle is designed to turn that small, forgettable task into a feel good habit.</p><div class=\"story-list\"><div><span class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> A gentle glow when it's time to sip</div><div><span class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Your progress, without the pressure</div><div><span class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> Beautiful enough to bring everywhere</div></div></div></div></section>"
        },
        "elements": []
      }
    ]
