        "widgetType": "html",
        "settings": {
          "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"how\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">It starts simple</span><h2>A better day, one sip at a time.</h2><p>Three small steps. One habit that stays.</p></div><div class=\"how-grid\"><article class=\"how-card reveal\"><div class=\"how-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"5\" width=\"12\" height=\"23\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M13 5V2h6v3M13 13h6\"/></svg></div><div><small>01 / FILL</small><h3>Start fresh</h3><p>Fill the bottle and take it wherever the day takes you.</p></div></article><article class=\"how-card reveal\"><div class=\"how-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"><path d=\"M16 3v4m0 18v4M3 16h4m18 0h4M7 7l3 3m12 12 3 3M25 7l-3 3M10 22l-3 3\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"7\"/></svg></div><div><small>02 / NOTICE</small><h3>Follow the glow</h3><p>A gentle light helps you pause and take a refreshing sip.</p></div></article><article class=\"how-card reveal\"><div class=\"how-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"><path d=\"m5 18 7 7L27 8\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"14\"/></svg></div><div><small>03 / FEEL</small><h3>Find your rhythm</h3><p>Let a tiny daily ritual become a lasting good habit.</p></div></article></div></div></section>"
