          "html": "<section class=\"section compare\" id=\"compare\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Why Hydration</span><h2>Ordinary water bottle?<br>Not quite.</h2></div><div class=\"reveal\"><table class=\"compare-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">The details</th><th scope=\"col\">Smart bottle</th><th scope=\"col\">The usual bottle</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hydration reminders</td><td class=\"yes\">Gentle light cue</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Temperature</td><td class=\"yes\">Insulated all day</td><td>Varies</td></tr><tr><td>Daily carry</td><td class=\"yes\">Made for the everyday</td><td>Often an afterthought</td></tr><tr><td>Mindful routine</td><td class=\"yes\">Built into the design</td><td>Up to you</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>"
