        "settings": {
          "html": "<section class=\"section pricing\" id=\"pricing\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"pricing-top\"><div class=\"section-head reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Clear from the start</span><h2>Choose your<br>better rhythm.</h2><p>The bottle works on its own. Add the companion plan when you want more insight and flexible goals.</p></div><div class=\"billing-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Billing period\"><button type=\"button\" data-billing=\"monthly\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Monthly</button><button type=\"button\" data-billing=\"yearly\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Yearly · save 20%</button></div></div><div class=\"price-card reveal\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Optional membership</span><h3>Companion plan</h3><p>Personal goals and progress insights, with the freedom to cancel. The bottle is sold separately.</p></div><div class=\"price-details\"><div class=\"price\" aria-live=\"polite\"><span id=\"price-value\">$12</span><small id=\"price-period\"> / month</small></div><p id=\"price-note\">Billed monthly. Bottle sold separately; its price will be confirmed before orders open.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"#waitlist\">Get early access <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>"
