        "id": "fe0de7a2",
        "elType": "widget",
        "widgetType": "html",
        "settings": {
          "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"container faq-grid\"><div class=\"section-head reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Good to know</span><h2>A few things you might ask.</h2><p>Still curious? Join the list for launch details.</p></div><div class=\"faq-list reveal\"><details><summary>When does early access open?</summary><p>We're aiming for March 15, 2027. Join the waitlist and we'll email you when early access opens.</p></details><details><summary>Does joining the waitlist cost anything?</summary><p>No. Joining is free and does not commit you to a purchase.</p></details><details><summary>How do referrals work?</summary><p>After signing up, you'll get a personal link. Each new friend who joins through it counts toward your referrals and moves you up the early access list.</p></details><details><summary>Is the bottle included in the plan?</summary><p>No. The companion plan is optional and the bottle is sold separately. We will confirm the bottle price before orders open.</p></details><details><summary>Will I need an app?</summary><p>No. The bottle's light reminders work on their own. The companion experience is optional.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change my mind?</summary><p>Yes. You can unsubscribe from launch emails at any time.</p></details></div></div></section>"
        },
